  "notes": "USAGE:\n{浮上|ふじょう} functions as a noun and as a する verb ({浮上|ふじょう}する). The figurative sense (sense 2) is extremely common in news reporting.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {問題|もんだい}が{浮上|ふじょう}する (a problem emerges)\n- {候補|こうほ}に{浮上|ふじょう}する (to emerge as a candidate)\n- {疑惑|ぎわく}が{浮上|ふじょう}する (suspicion comes to light)\n- {海面|かいめん}に{浮上|ふじょう}する (to surface)",
